> Witness: L1 1778 (c1, kb, menu, trail1, warp).
$6D88 c Dissolve ; Bring the buffer onto the screen by eight passes of rotating its bits in from the sides
> HL the buffer, DE the screen address. Each pass rotates each line's 22 bytes, the left 11 through RotateLeft and the right through RotateRight, so the picture slides in from both sides, with a delay of $1E x 256 loops between passes. Used by the title, the high scores, the menus and the trail intro (c1: 28 calls).
> Witness: L1 29 (c1, empty, fuel, kb, menu, trail1, trails, warp).
$6DC1 c RotateLeft ; Rotate a buffer byte left into the screen byte
> Witness: L1 204160 (c1, empty, fuel, kb, menu, trail1, trails, warp).
$6DC9 c RotateRight ; Rotate a buffer byte right into the screen byte
> Witness: L1 204160 (c1, empty, fuel, kb, menu, trail1, trails, warp).
$6DD1 c ClearScreen ; Border black, clear the screen and its attributes ($45), wait for no key, 60 frames
> Also the main menu's START action: the menu returns to NewGame.
> Witness: L1 22 (c1, empty, fuel, kb, trail1, trails, warp).
