@res trails/trails14.bin
$800A b Trail4ListB 6 ; Trail 4's list B
@res trails/trails14.bin
$8042 b AnimRecords ; The animation records of trails 1-4's animated objects
> An item whose flags have bits 4-7 set points here: +0 the sprite, +1 the flags, +2 the object's id (AnimObject keeps a list of 30 seen ids), then the record's own bytes (the frames and the motion), up to $FF.
@res trails/trails14.bin
